{
    "chapter_num": 13,
    "verses_count": 18,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Abram Inherits Canaan"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Abram went up from Egypt, he and his wife and all that he had, and Lot with him, to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. Negev"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "South. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Abram "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " very rich in livestock, in silver, and in gold. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he went on his journey from the South as far as Bethel, to the place where his tent had been at the beginning, between Bethel and Ai, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to the place of the altar which he had made there at first. And there Abram called on the name of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Lot also, who went with Abram, had flocks and herds and tents. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the land was not able to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. bear"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "support them, that they might dwell together, for their possessions were so great that they could not dwell together. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And there was strife between the herdsmen of Abram’s livestock and the herdsmen of Lot’s livestock. The Canaanites and the Perizzites then dwelt in the land."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Abram said to Lot, “Please let there be no strife between you and me, and between my herdsmen and your herdsmen; for we "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " brethren. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not the whole land before you? Please separate from me. If "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you take"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the left, then I will go to the right; or, if "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you go"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to the right, then I will go to the left.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Lot lifted his eyes and saw all the plain of Jordan, that it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " well watered everywhere (before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " destroyed Sodom and Gomorrah) like the garden of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", like the land of Egypt as you go toward Zoar. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Lot chose for himself all the plain of Jordan, and Lot journeyed east. And they separated from each other. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Abram dwelt in the land of Canaan, and Lot dwelt in the cities of the plain and pitched "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "his"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " tent even as far as Sodom. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the men of Sodom "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " exceedingly wicked and sinful against the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to Abram, after Lot had separated from him: “Lift your eyes now and look from the place where you are—northward, southward, eastward, and westward; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for all the land which you see I give to you and your "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. seed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "descendants forever. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I will make your descendants as the dust of the earth; so that if a man could number the dust of the earth, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "then"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your descendants also could be numbered. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Arise, walk in the land through its length and its width, for I give it to you.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Abram moved "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "his"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " tent, and went and dwelt by "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. Alon Mamre"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the terebinth trees of Mamre, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in Hebron, and built an altar there to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}